{"sha": "10d78c0f1111579d0a4da7764ca4cfa97e9d4286", "message": "bump version", "created_at": "2022-06-23T07:14:12Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "89169657059cce7b25a0e6e7d2531011aa0cba59", "message": "Merge pull request #51 from hexaeder/hw/convenince\n\nadd several convenience functions", "created_at": "2022-06-23T07:13:37Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9418738c9d138bb5620cf11694f3467ceb62cc23", "message": "Merge branch 'main' into hw/convenince", "created_at": "2022-06-23T06:27:27Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "afb08c1e1484b0017e2f776c69833d515147a3f7", "message": "bump version", "created_at": "2022-05-31T12:09:45Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1f1a37c0e1ce50f3d7a4bcd81f7e477fce210a0a", "message": "Merge pull request #56 from hexaeder/fixpromotion\n\nfix namespace promotion with nested blocks", "created_at": "2022-05-31T12:09:20Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5e81a8d52800a9d9f814f771785ef16632db4b6a", "message": "fix namespace promotion with nested blocks", "created_at": "2022-05-31T11:55:52Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b381168c956da47f41d4b4257dfc72f3982c7794", "message": "pin MTK@7 and Symbolics@4.3", "created_at": "2022-05-06T15:35:03Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8266be0ed3af8d906d9bbf3ea0d1481d851393bd", "message": "fix version conflict with Symbolics", "created_at": "2022-04-22T09:47:46Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3e2a4638fa914e9274121425873516cffdc2d052", "message": "temp fix dropped metadata", "created_at": "2022-04-21T09:07:17Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c99775a40dfa720e4df7f21df210ae111e98f9cd", "message": "bump version", "created_at": "2022-04-21T09:06:20Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "57cf52bf253b62e5c8ecbf1d06db8a0c9d716600", "message": "don't warn for missing removed states\n\nalso don't warn if there is only one entry", "created_at": "2022-02-18T09:05:23Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ac917eedc2225d2ff5b6d223d2d560ef849e06c5", "message": "expand derivs after output->input substitution\n\notheris this might lead to D(x+y) type derivatives in the rhs\nwhich can't be handled in ODESystem", "created_at": "2022-02-18T08:53:08Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0c28f565cf2a77ef312b57f7432190a2898f9f4e", "message": "multilevel algebraic substitution rules\n\nsubstitutions lead to a number of implicit alg. equations.\nLets try to solve those and resubstitute again.", "created_at": "2022-02-16T13:31:13Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "14d5fe1005bedf802c54be6189631b13663a17d3", "message": "move solving of implicit eqs to utils", "created_at": "2022-02-16T13:31:13Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6cd23ddff9804337eed15042130cc87d65238ce9", "message": "substitute rules according to dependency graph\n\nrecursive substitution is not necessary anymore", "created_at": "2022-02-16T13:31:13Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a77f5c620fecb3b4ad2890f45c65ec1599d95ddc", "message": "faster cycle detection in algebraic substitutions", "created_at": "2022-02-16T13:31:13Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dddb3038118d927d528f50b9843aec9ae3e257e1", "message": "hand warn parameter through", "created_at": "2022-02-16T13:31:13Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4690b74747c53b397cea698837022ed69e86174d", "message": "keep closed inputs in removed_eqs\n\nwith this, connections like (b1.a + b2.b) => b3.input can be\naccessed from the solutions object!", "created_at": "2022-02-16T13:31:13Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6f17b820a8fdf748d4ba6f3c30f88103e08bcb2f", "message": "change substitution strategy\n\n- first explicit diffeqs (because they can't contain loops)\n- then explicit algebraic eqs\n- if substitution yields implicit algebraic equations, tries to solve those\n  for explicit algebraic equations!", "created_at": "2022-02-16T13:31:13Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "29750daeb3c0a4389703a83200f723f65374c800", "message": "add conv function to create ODEFunction from block\n\nauto include massmatrix and symbols", "created_at": "2022-02-16T13:31:13Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1822e94192544360eefd833fddfa719035278bc8", "message": "add set_input function to close input of block", "created_at": "2022-02-16T13:30:54Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5e8a37ef39c4175975e8309830dbc3783a6ebc34", "message": "tweak set_p function\n\n- better internal handling of different inputs\n- warn instead of error if symbol is not present", "created_at": "2022-02-16T13:29:28Z", "repo": "BlockSystems.jl", "file_sampled": false, "h